[Script]
http-request ^https?:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/resource\/fingerprint\? script-path=https://github.com/ifflagged/Romeo/raw/main/Modules/JavaScript/zirawell/bilibili/zirawell_bilibili.js, tag=哔哩哔哩-Cookie-App

